+     * path -> CN0. SH1/CN0 are one-bit enable BCMs. MC0/SH0 use the
+     * saturating 14-bit X/Y wire maximum, covering any inherited HLOS
+     * demand without reducing it. Temporary bring-up: no DVFS or release,
+     * and no deep sleep. ACV's performance-mask policy is not modified. */
